<title>USA: Firm raises Southwest Bancorp stake.</title>
<headline>Firm raises Southwest Bancorp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Fidelity Assurance Co, of Oklahoma City, Okla., said Tuesday it raised its stake in Southwest Bancorp Inc to 6.55 percent or 246,300 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, American Fidelity said it bought 43,000 shares between July 16 and September 13 at prices ranging from $18.50 to $18.75 a share.</p>
